WEBVTT

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:01.870
Okay, so you went from zero to

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:04.840
a hundred thousand followers in one year.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:05.840
How?

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.840
Honestly, I posted every single day,

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:12.120
even when nobody was watching.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.440
Every single day?

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.440
Every day.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:15.440
The first fifty,

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.040
but that's how you get good.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.350
So what's your one tip for someone

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:20.760
starting today?

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.120
Start before you're ready.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.080
Just post the thing.

